text.en:
A REST API returns:

{
  "device": {
    "name": "R1",
    "interfaces": ["Gig0/0", "Gig0/1", "Gig0/2"]
  }
}

Which value does a script retrieve when it reads element 1 of the "interfaces" array?

text.hi:
Ek REST API yeh return karti hai:

{
  "device": {
    "name": "R1",
    "interfaces": ["Gig0/0", "Gig0/1", "Gig0/2"]
  }
}

Jab script "interfaces" array ka element 1 padhti hai, toh use kaunsi value milti hai?

text.en:
Examine this JSON returned by a controller:

{
  "vlans": [
    { "id": 10, "name": "USERS" },
    { "id": 20, "name": "VOICE" },
    { "id": 30, "name": "MGMT" }
  ]
}

Which statement about the structure is accurate?

text.hi:
Controller se aaya yeh JSON dekho:

{
  "vlans": [
    { "id": 10, "name": "USERS" },
    { "id": 20, "name": "VOICE" },
    { "id": 30, "name": "MGMT" }
  ]
}

Structure ke baare mein kaunsa statement sahi hai?

text.en:
